              {
                "variables": {
                  "prompt": "You are a home climate AI. Analyze the sensor data and recommend HVAC adjustments.\n                Respond ONLY with valid JSON, no markdown, no thinking, no commentary.\n                Top-level keys: setpoint (null or 21.5-24.0C), hvac_mode (heat/cool/off/auto/null),\n                fans (object: each of kitchen/master/mina/guest/izaan = off|1|2|3), blinds (object: dining/family/living/mina = 0-100 or no_change), vent_boosters (object: izaan/mina = 0-100 percentage or null),\n                reason (string). Rooms: kitchen, master, mina, guest, izaan. Speed: 1-3 or off (1=slow, 2=medium, 3=high).\n                Perceived temps (pre-calculated): Dn={{ ((states('sensor.downstairs_echo_dot_temperature') | float(states('sensor.izaans_room_temperature') | float(21)) + (states('sensor.ecobee_current_humidity') | float(45) - 45) * 0.1) | round(1)) }}C Up={{ ((states('sensor.upstairs_echo_dot_temperature') | float(states('sensor.minas_room_temperature') | float(21)) + (states('sensor.ecobee_current_humidity') | float(45) - 45) * 0.1) | round(1)) }}C. Humidity >55% feels warmer, <35% feels cooler.\n                Summer=prefer Cool, fans on. When switching between heat and cool, set the desired mode directly..\n                Winter=prefer Heat, fans off/low.\n                Outdoor: {{ state_attr(\"weather.forecast_home\", \"temperature\") }}C\n                Humidity: E={{ states(\"sensor.ecobee_current_humidity\") }}% S={{ state_attr(\"weather.forecast_home\", \"humidity\") }}%\n                Echo: Dn={{ states(\"sensor.downstairs_echo_dot_temperature\") }}C Up={{ states(\"sensor.upstairs_echo_dot_temperature\") }}C\n                Indoor: Iz={{ states(\"sensor.izaans_room_temperature\") }}C Mi={{ states(\"sensor.minas_room_temperature\") }}C Bsmt={{ states(\"sensor.basement_temperature\") }}C\n                Ecobee: {{ states(\"climate.ecobee\") }}\n                LeakSensorTemperatures: BB={{ states(\"sensor.basement_bathroom_leak_sensor_device_temperature\") }}C Ensuite={{ states(\"sensor.ensuite_leak_sensor_device_temperature\") }}C GuestB={{ states(\"sensor.guest_bathroom_leak_sensor_device_temperature\") }}C Powder={{ states(\"sensor.powder_room_leak_sensor_device_temperature\") }}C Laundry={{ states(\"sensor.laundry_room_leak_sensor_device_temperature\") }}C  hvac={{ state_attr(\"climate.ecobee\", \"hvac_action\") }} target={{ state_attr(\"climate.ecobee\", \"temperature\") }}C\\n                Occ:\\  Arshad={{ states(\"person.arshad14\") }} Larissa={{ \"home\" if is_state(\"binary_sensor.larissa_s_s22_presence\",\"on\") else \"away\" }} WFHWorkday={{ \"yes\" if is_state(\"calendar.workday_sensor_calendar\",\"on\") else \"no\" }} (Arshad works from home on workdays)\n                Szn={{ \"Summer\" if is_state(\"input_boolean.climate_summer_mode\", \"on\") else \"Winter\" }}\n                Fans: K={{ states(\"fan.kitchen_ceiling_fan\") }} M={{ states(\"fan.master_bedroom_ceiling_fan\") }} Mi={{ states(\"fan.mina_s_ceiling_fan\") }} G={{ states(\"fan.guest_room_ceiling_fan\") }} Iz={{ states(\"fan.izaan_s_ceiling_fan\") }}\n                Ceiling fans (kitchen/master/mina/guest/izaan): set each off|1|2|3 (1=33%,2=66%,3=100%). The automation powers each fan switch on before setting speed; switch state (not fan state) is truth. Turn fans on when cooling helps; off when not needed. VentBoosters: Iz={{ states(\"fan.izaan_s_room_20a970\") }}@{{ state_attr(\"fan.izaan_s_room_20a970\", \"percentage\") }}% Mi={{ states(\"fan.mina_s_room_f851f4\") }}@{{ state_attr(\"fan.mina_s_room_f851f4\", \"percentage\") }}%\n                Sw: KFn={{ states(\"switch.kitchen_fan_switch_1\") }} MFn={{ states(\"switch.master_bedroom_fan_light_switch_1\") }}\n                Doors: Front={{ \"open\" if is_state(\"binary_sensor.front_door_door\", \"on\") else \"closed\" }}{{ \"/unlocked\" if is_state(\"lock.front_door\", \"unlocked\") else \"\" }} GE={{ \"open\" if is_state(\"binary_sensor.garages_entry_door_door\", \"on\") else \"closed\" }}{{ \"/unlocked\" if is_state(\"lock.garages_entry_door\", \"unlocked\") else \"\" }}\n                Blinds: DR={{ state_attr(\"cover.dining_room_blinds_curtain\",\"current_position\") }}%open FR={{ state_attr(\"cover.family_room_blinds_curtain\",\"current_position\") }}%open MR={{ state_attr(\"cover.mina_s_blinds_curtain\",\"current_position\") }}%open\n                TV: FR_LG={{ states(\"media_player.lg_webos_tv_un8500auj\") }}\n                Weather: {{ states(\"weather.forecast_home\") }} UV={{ state_attr(\"weather.forecast_home\", \"uv_index\") }} Clouds={{ state_attr(\"weather.forecast_home\", \"cloud_coverage\") }}%\n                Sun={{ states(\"sun.sun\") }} Azimuth={{ state_attr(\"sun.sun\", \"azimuth\") }} deg Elevation={{ state_attr(\"sun.sun\", \"elevation\") }} deg\n                Window facings: dining={{ states(\"input_number.window_dining_room_facing\") }} deg living={{ states(\"input_number.window_living_room_facing\") }} deg family={{ states(\"input_number.window_family_room_facing\") }} deg mina={{ states(\"input_number.window_minas_room_facing\") }} deg master={{ states(\"input_number.window_master_bedroom_facing\") }} deg izaan={{ states(\"input_number.window_izaans_room_facing\") }} deg\n                Layout: main floor (elev {{ states(\"input_number.house_elevation\") }}m): kitchen, family, living, dining. Second floor (elev {{ states(\"input_number.house_elevation_second_floor\") }}m): master, mina, izaan, guest. Family is directly below Mina, Living is directly below Izaan, and Kitchen is directly below Master (heat rises between stacked rooms). Kitchen and Family face the same direction as Mina and Master; Izaan is on the exactly opposite side of the house from Mina; Guest is next to Izaan and faces the same direction as Izaan. Ceiling height {{ states(\"input_number.ceiling_height\") }}m.\n                Rules: Only recommend blind changes when sun ABOVE horizon (elevation > 0). If cloudy >40% or UV<2 or elevation<15\u00b0, keep blinds open. If UV>5, close blinds on sunny side (azimuth within 45 deg).\n                All HVAC, fan, and temperature decisions are now handled by this AI. Do not wait for other automations.\n                Summer: close blinds on sunny side (azimuth within 45 deg), OPEN blinds on rooms NOT facing sun.\n                Winter: keep all blinds open for passive solar. If hvac_action=heating: keep all blinds open.\n                Output JSON: {\"setpoint\":N, \"hvac_mode\":\"...\", \"fans\":{\"kitchen\":\"off|1|2|3\",\"master\":\"...\",\"mina\":\"...\",\"guest\":\"...\",\"izaan\":\"...\"}, \"blinds\":{\"dining\":N,\"family\":N,\"living\":N,\"mina\":N}, \"vent_boosters\":{\"izaan\":N,\"mina\":N}, \"reason\":\"...\"}\n                blinds values: 0-100 or \"no_change\". Use partial values (25,50,75) to block some sun. Blinds covered: dining, family, living, mina. Prefer PARTIAL positions to balance sun/glare/heat. Only move blinds when sun is up; at night a separate automation closes them.\nFront door: FrontOpenDuration={{ (as_timestamp(now()) | int(0) - as_timestamp(states.binary_sensor.front_door_door.last_changed | default(now(), true)) | int(as_timestamp(now()))) // 60 if is_state('binary_sensor.front_door_door','on') else 0 }}min. If FrontOpenDuration > 10 (front door left open >10 min): factor this in \u2014 HVAC is being wasted, so ease off cooling/heating (do not run aggressively), recommend closing the door, and note reduced efficiency.\nVent booster fans: izaan_s_room_20a970 and mina_s_room_f851f4. If a room is too hot/cold and the ceiling fan is already on, boost the vent. Values: 0-100 (percentage), or null to leave as-is. HARD LIMIT: Between 9PM-7AM, max 30%.\nELECTRICITY RATES (Alectra ULO - Ultra-Low Overnight Time-of-Use):\n WEEKDAYS:\n  11PM-7AM: Ultra-Low Overnight (3.9\u00a2/kWh) - CHEAPEST - PREFER to run HVAC\n  7AM-4PM: Mid-Peak (15.7\u00a2/kWh) - Moderate\n  4PM-9PM: On-Peak (39.1\u00a2/kWh) - VERY EXPENSIVE - AVOID running HVAC\n  9PM-11PM: Mid-Peak (15.7\u00a2/kWh) - Moderate\n WEEKENDS & HOLIDAYS:\n  11PM-7AM: Ultra-Low Overnight (3.9\u00a2/kWh) - CHEAPEST\n  7AM-11PM: Weekend Off-Peak (9.8\u00a2/kWh) - Moderate (all day)\nRULES:\n  Weekdays: Pre-cool during Ultra-Low Overnight (11PM-7AM) to shift load from expensive 4PM-9PM peak.\n  Weekdays 4PM-9PM: Avoid AC if possible. Use fans instead if outdoor < indoor.\n  Weekends: Full day off-peak at 9.8\u00a2. Standard HVAC operation.\n  Summer: overcool by 1-2C during Ultra-Low Overnight so house drifts through 4-9PM peak.\nCurrent Ontario Time: {{ now().strftime('%A %H:%M') }}"
                }
              },
              {
                "action": "rest_command.climate_ai_gemini",
                "data": {
                  "prompt": "{{ prompt }}"
                },
                "response_variable": "ai_response"
              },
              {
                "variables": {
                  "ai_raw": "{{ ai_response.content.candidates[0].content.parts[0].text if ai_response.content.candidates is defined and ai_response.content.candidates and ai_response.content.candidates[0].content is defined and ai_response.content.candidates[0].content.parts is defined and ai_response.content.candidates[0].content.parts else '' }}",
                  "ai_json": "{{ ai_raw if ai_raw is mapping else (ai_raw | regex_replace('(?i)```json\\s*', '') | regex_replace('(?i)```\\s*', '') | trim | from_json if ai_raw is string and ai_raw | trim != '' and (ai_raw | trim | regex_search('[\\{\\[]')) else {}) }}",
                  "hvac_mode": "{{ ai_json.hvac_mode | default(none, true) }}",
                  "setpoint": "{{ ai_json.setpoint | default(none) }}",
                  "reason": "{{ ai_json.reason | default('No recommendation', true) }}"
                }
              },
              {
                "if": [
                  {
                    "condition": "template",
                    "value_template": "{{ hvac_mode is not none and hvac_mode | lower != 'none' }}"
                  }
                ],
                "then": [
                  {
                    "action": "climate.set_hvac_mode",
                    "data": {
                      "hvac_mode": "{{ hvac_mode }}"
                    },
                    "target": {
                      "entity_id": "climate.ecobee"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "if": [
                  {
                    "condition": "template",
                    "value_template": "{{ is_state('binary_sensor.front_door_door', 'on') }}"
                  }
                ],
                "then": [
                  {
                    "action": "notify.mobile_app_cph2655",
                    "data": {
                      "message": "Front door is open while HVAC is running. Close it to save energy.",
                      "title": "Front Door Open"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "repeat": {
                  "for_each": [
                    {
                      "room": "kitchen",
                      "fan": "fan.kitchen_ceiling_fan",
                      "sw": "switch.kitchen_fan_switch_1",
                      "occ": "binary_sensor.kitchen_presence"
                    },
                    {
                      "room": "master",
                      "fan": "fan.master_bedroom_ceiling_fan",
                      "sw": "switch.master_bedroom_fan_light_switch_1",
                      "occ": "binary_sensor.332d_occupancy"
                    },
                    {
                      "room": "mina",
                      "fan": "fan.mina_s_ceiling_fan",
                      "sw": "switch.mina_s_light_switch_1",
                      "occ": "binary_sensor.minas_room_occupancy"
                    },
                    {
                      "room": "guest",
                      "fan": "fan.guest_room_ceiling_fan",
                      "sw": "switch.guest_room_light_switch_1",
                      "occ": "binary_sensor.bbwg_occupancy"
                    },
                    {
                      "room": "izaan",
                      "fan": "fan.izaan_s_ceiling_fan",
                      "sw": "switch.izaan_s_bedroom_light_switch_1",
                      "occ": "binary_sensor.izaans_room_occupancy"
                    }
                  ],
                  "sequence": [
                    {
                      "variables": {
                        "spd": "{{ ai_json.get('fans', {}).get(repeat.item.room, 'no_change') if ai_json is mapping else 'no_change' }}",
                        "pct": "{{ {'1':33,'2':66,'3':100}.get(spd | string, 0) }}"
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "choose": [
                        {
                          "conditions": "{{ spd not in [none, 'no_change'] and (spd | string) != 'off' }}",
                          "sequence": [
                            {
                              "action": "switch.turn_on",
                              "target": {
                                "entity_id": "{{ repeat.item.sw }}"
                              }
                            },
                            {
                              "delay": {
                                "seconds": 2
                              }
                            },
                            {
                              "action": "fan.set_percentage",
                              "target": {
                                "entity_id": "{{ repeat.item.fan }}"
                              },
                              "data": {
                                "percentage": "{{ pct }}"
                              }
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "conditions": "{{ (spd | string) == 'off' }}",
                          "sequence": [
                            {
                              "action": "fan.turn_off",
                              "target": {
                                "entity_id": "{{ repeat.item.fan }}"
                              }
                            },
                            {
                              "if": [
                                {
                                  "condition": "template",
                                  "value_template": "{{ states(repeat.item.occ) == 'off' }}"
                                }
                              ],
                              "then": [
                                {
                                  "action": "switch.turn_off",
                                  "target": {
                                    "entity_id": "{{ repeat.item.sw }}"
                                  }
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "if": [
                  {
                    "condition": "template",
                    "value_template": "{{ ai_json.blinds is mapping and ai_json.blinds.dining is defined and ai_json.blinds.dining | string | lower != 'no_change' }}"
                  },
                  {
                    "condition": "template",
                    "value_template": "{{ state_attr(\"sun.sun\", \"elevation\") | float(-1) > -5 }}"
                  }
                ],
                "then": [
                  {
                    "action": "cover.set_cover_position",
                    "data": {
                      "position": "{{ ai_json.blinds.dining | int(100) | clamp(0, 100) }}"
                    },
                    "target": {
                      "entity_id": "cover.dining_room_blinds_curtain"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "if": [
                  {
                    "condition": "template",
                    "value_template": "{{ ai_json.blinds is mapping and ai_json.blinds.family is defined and ai_json.blinds.family | string | lower != 'no_change' }}"
                  },
                  {
                    "condition": "template",
                    "value_template": "{{ state_attr(\"sun.sun\", \"elevation\") | float(-1) > -5 }}"
                  }
                ],
                "then": [
                  {
                    "action": "cover.set_cover_position",
                    "data": {
                      "position": "{{ ai_json.blinds.family | int(100) | clamp(0, 100) }}"
                    },
                    "target": {
                      "entity_id": "cover.family_room_blinds_curtain"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "if": [
                  {
                    "condition": "template",
                    "value_template": "{{ ai_json.blinds is mapping and ai_json.blinds.mina is defined and ai_json.blinds.mina | string | lower != 'no_change' }}"
                  },
                  {
                    "condition": "template",
                    "value_template": "{{ state_attr(\"sun.sun\", \"elevation\") | float(-1) > -5 }}"
                  }
                ],
                "then": [
                  {
                    "action": "cover.set_cover_position",
                    "data": {
                      "position": "{{ ai_json.blinds.mina | int(100) | clamp(0, 100) }}"
                    },
                    "target": {
                      "entity_id": "cover.mina_s_blinds_curtain"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "if": [
                  {
                    "condition": "template",
                    "value_template": "{{ ai_json.blinds is mapping and ai_json.blinds.living is defined and ai_json.blinds.living | string | lower != 'no_change' }}"
                  },
                  {
                    "condition": "template",
                    "value_template": "{{ state_attr(\"sun.sun\", \"elevation\") | float(-1) > -5 }}"
                  }
                ],
                "then": [
                  {
                    "action": "cover.set_cover_position",
                    "data": {
                      "position": "{{ ai_json.blinds.living | int(100) | clamp(0, 100) }}"
                    },
                    "target": {
                      "entity_id": "cover.living_room_blinds_curtain"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "if": [
                  {
                    "condition": "template",
                    "value_template": "{{ ai_json.vent_boosters is mapping and ai_json.vent_boosters.izaan is defined and ai_json.vent_boosters.izaan != None and ai_json.vent_boosters.izaan | int >= 0 and ai_json.vent_boosters.izaan | int <= 100 }}"
                  }
                ],
                "then": [
                  {
                    "action": "fan.set_percentage",
                    "data": {
                      "percentage": "{{ [[(ai_json.vent_boosters.izaan | default(0, true)) | int(0), 0] | max, 30] | min if now().hour >= 21 or now().hour < 7 else [(ai_json.vent_boosters.izaan | default(0, true)) | int(0), 0] | max }}"
                    },
                    "target": {
                      "entity_id": "fan.izaan_s_room_20a970"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "if": [
                  {
                    "condition": "template",
                    "value_template": "{{ ai_json.vent_boosters is mapping and ai_json.vent_boosters.mina is defined and ai_json.vent_boosters.mina != None and ai_json.vent_boosters.mina | int >= 0 and ai_json.vent_boosters.mina | int <= 100 }}"
                  }
                ],
                "then": [
                  {
                    "action": "fan.set_percentage",
                    "data": {
                      "percentage": "{{ [[(ai_json.vent_boosters.mina | default(0, true)) | int(0), 0] | max, 30] | min if now().hour >= 21 or now().hour < 7 else [(ai_json.vent_boosters.mina | default(0, true)) | int(0), 0] | max }}"
                    },
                    "target": {
                      "entity_id": "fan.mina_s_room_f851f4"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "if": [
                  {
                    "condition": "template",
                    "value_template": "{{ setpoint is not none and (setpoint | float(-99) >= 20.0 and setpoint | float(-99) <= 26.0) }}"
                  }
                ],
                "then": [
                  {
                    "action": "climate.set_temperature",
                    "data": {
                      "temperature": "{{ setpoint }}"
                    },
                    "target": {
                      "entity_id": "climate.ecobee"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "if": [
                  {
                    "condition": "template",
                    "value_template": "{{ setpoint is not none or hvac_mode is not none or (ai_json.fans is mapping and ai_json.fans | length > 0) }}"
                  }
                ],
                "then": [
                  {
                    "action": "notify.persistent_notification",
                    "data": {
                      "message": "Set: {{ setpoint }}C Mode: {{ hvac_mode }} Fans: {% set ns = namespace(p=[]) %}{% for k, v in (ai_json.fans | default({})).items() %}{% if v != 'no_change' %}{% set ns.p = ns.p + [k ~ '=' ~ v] %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}{{ ns.p | join(', ') }} Vents: Iz={{ ai_json.vent_boosters.izaan if ai_json.vent_boosters is mapping and ai_json.vent_boosters.izaan is defined else '--' }}% Mi={{ ai_json.vent_boosters.mina if ai_json.vent_boosters is mapping and ai_json.vent_boosters.mina is defined else '--' }}% Blinds: {{ ai_json.blinds | to_json if ai_json.blinds is mapping else 'none' }} - {{ reason }}",
                      "title": "Climate AI: {{ setpoint }}C {{ hvac_mode }}"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "if": [
                  {
                    "condition": "template",
                    "value_template": "{{ setpoint is not none or hvac_mode is not none or (ai_json.fans is defined and ai_json.fans is mapping) or (ai_json.blinds is mapping and (ai_json.blinds.dining is defined or ai_json.blinds.family is defined or ai_json.blinds.mina is defined)) }}"
                  }
                ],
                "then": [
                  {
                    "action": "notify.mobile_app_cph2655",
                    "data": {
                      "message": "Climate AI: {{ 'No change' if setpoint == 'no_change' else 'Set ' ~ setpoint ~ 'C ' ~ hvac_mode }}{% set ns2 = namespace(p=[]) %}{% for k, v in (ai_json.fans | default({})).items() %}{% if v != 'no_change' %}{% set ns2.p = ns2.p + [k ~ '=' ~ v] %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}{{ ' Fans: ' ~ ns2.p | join(', ') if ns2.p | length > 0 else '' }} - {{ reason }}",
                      "title": "Climate AI"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "max": 2,
            "mode": "queued"
          },
          "blueprint_inputs": null,
          "context": {
            "id": "01KX9GH6CGM44DXZE55GE8THJM",
            "parent_id": null,
            "user_id": null
          }
        },
